  "details": "Pretty straightforward, i get the idea of not spamming pics because people's computer cannot handle 4k quickly, but having no option for those of us who have the rig to support it, it would be nice to be able to take pictures faster. the cooldown is just long enough to not be able to catch precious action shots in high speed situations.\n\nSolution, just a behavior toggle in the camera or one of the big menus with a performance warning that allows us to just take way more per second on camera click.\n\nthank you!",
